sequenceDiagram
    participant Clients
    participant RDT_Recv as RDTReceiver (Gen)
    participant ServeLoop as SMTPServer._serve_loop
    participant ThreadPool as ThreadPoolExecutor
    participant Handler as _process_packet
    participant Storage as StorageManager

    Note over ServeLoop: Runs in Main Thread

    Clients->>RDT_Recv: Sends Packet (UDP)
    RDT_Recv->>ServeLoop: Yields (Data, Addr)
    
    ServeLoop->>ServeLoop: Update Session Timeout (Reaper)
    
    alt Address is New
        ServeLoop->>ServeLoop: Create Session Dict
        ServeLoop->>Clients: Send 220 Welcome
    end

    Note over ServeLoop: NON-BLOCKING SUBMISSION
    ServeLoop->>ThreadPool: submit(_process_packet, addr, data)
    
    par Worker Thread Execution
        ThreadPool->>Handler: Start Task
        Handler->>Handler: Check SMTP State
        
        alt Command (HELO, MAIL FROM)
            Handler->>Handler: Update Session State
            Handler->>Clients: Send Reply (via RDTSender)
        else Data Stream (Email Body)
            Handler->>Handler: Buffer Data
            
            opt End of Message (CRLF.CRLF)
                Handler->>Storage: save_email() (File I/O)
                Storage-->>Handler: Path Saved
                Handler->>Clients: Send 250 OK
            end
        end
    and Main Loop Continues
        ServeLoop->>RDT_Recv: Get Next Packet
    end
